Portrait of a fantasy D&D character. A handsome human man in his 30s, the kind everyone turns to look at. Perfect smile that never reaches his eyes — charming but unsettling. Dark wavy hair, clean-shaven, impeccable posture. Wearing luxurious bard's clothes — deep purple velvet doublet with gold trim, rings on his fingers. One hand resting on a lute. His expression says "I know something you don't." Background: opulent candlelit hall, slightly hazy/dreamlike (he's a ghost/memory). Style: realistic fantasy portrait, golden warm lighting with a subtle sinister undertone, waist-up.
